      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "The challenge in this petition is made to the order dated 16.07.2024, passed in Criminal Complaint Case No.4 of 2024 CIS No.9 of 2024, Sompal vs. Munesh and others, by the court of District and Sessions Judge, Haridwar, District Haridwar.",
