      "summary_sent_score": 0.1632455587387085
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "By it, the petitioners have been summoned to answer the accusation under Sections 147, 148, 149, 323, 302, 324, 504, 506 IPC & Sections 3(r)(s) of the Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes (Prevention of Atrocities) Act, 1989.",
