      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5446333885192871
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Heard.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 934,
      "end": 941,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The case is based on a complaint filed by respondent no.2, who is represented before this Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 942,
      "end": 1039,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.220158651471138
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that the summoning order is bad in the eyes of law.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1041,
      "end": 1141,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The alleged incident took place on 16.12.2023.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1142,
      "end": 1188,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "16.12.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1177,
          "end": 1187
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.33469125628471375
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Four contusions were detected on the person of the wife of the respondent no.2 on 17.12.2023.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1189,
      "end": 1282,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "17.12.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1271,
          "end": 1281
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3882375955581665
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "She died on 30.03.2024, which is unconnected with any incident.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1283,
      "end": 1346,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "30.03.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1295,
          "end": 1305
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.44218385219573975
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "It is also argued that, in fact, respondent no.2 had encroached some land belonging to the State.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1347,
      "end": 1444,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2703290581703186
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "He wanted to grab the land.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1445,
      "end": 1472,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2741720974445343
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "He was in the habit of filing false complaints and grabbing money in the garb of settlement.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1473,
      "end": 1565,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3818219304084778
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "Learned counsel for respondent no.2 would submit that he would like to file objections.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1566,
      "end": 1654,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Having heard, this Court is of the view that this matter requires deliberation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1655,
      "end": 1735,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "Issue notice to the respondent nos.3 to 5 returnable within six weeks.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1737,
      "end": 1807,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.29803138971328735
    },
